  "Enable phone-style autocomplete, autocorrect, and spelling suggestions in the terminal command bar. Off by default so the keyboard never rewrites commands, flags, or paths. Direct keyboard input (when keys go straight to the terminal) always sends raw keystrokes, so suggestions don't apply there.": "在终端命令栏中启用手机式自动补全、自动纠错和拼写建议。默认关闭,以免键盘改写命令、参数或路径。直接键盘输入(按键直达终端)始终发送原始按键,因此不受此设置影响。",
  "Scale the terminal text. Smaller sizes fit more columns with side margins; larger sizes show fewer columns — drag sideways to pan. You can also pinch to zoom in the terminal itself, which updates this setting. Per-device display only; doesn't change the desktop terminal.": "调整终端文字大小。字号越小、可显示的列数越多(两侧留有边距);字号越大、列数越少——可左右拖动平移。你也可以在终端中双指缩放,该操作会同步更新此设置。仅影响本设备显示,不会改变桌面端终端。",
  "While you're using a terminal on your phone, Manta shrinks it to fit your screen. When you close the app or switch away, this controls whether it stays at phone size (so interactive CLI tools don't reflow) or resizes back to your desktop. You can always use Restore this terminal or Restore all terminals on the banner to resize manually.": "在手机上使用终端时,Manta 会将其缩小以适配屏幕。当你关闭应用或切换到其他应用时,此选项决定终端是保持手机尺寸(以免交互式 CLI 工具重排),还是恢复为桌面端尺寸。你随时可以用横幅上的“恢复此终端”或“恢复所有终端”手动调整。",
